Id: dns003w
Severity: WARN
Category: network
Check: check_dns
Fix: Replace it with the resolver's address.
References: resolv.conf(5)
Controls: CIS 4.1; NIST CM-6; ISO 8.9

A nameserver line in /etc/resolv.conf does not hold an IP address (a
name, 0.0.0.0, or a typo), so it is ignored. Names cannot bootstrap
from names: the resolver needs addresses to ask first.
